<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.6.4: Building Equivalent Systems</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00466</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.6.4: Building Equivalent Systems</md:title>
    <md:uuid>f82c1fb3-59fe-4920-8922-e1b43299fdf0</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001">
    <title>Cool Down Activity</title>
<para id="para-00001">Here is a system of equations:</para>
<para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00003">To solve this system, Diego wrote these equivalent systems for his first two steps.</para>

<para id="para-00004"><emphasis>Step 1</emphasis></para>
<para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>55</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00006"><emphasis>Step 2</emphasis></para>
<para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>70</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para><!--Question 1 -->
<exercise id="exer-00001">
  <problem id="prob-00001">
    <para id="para-00008">Describe the move that Diego made between the original system and step 1.</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="sol-00001">
  <para id="para-00009">Compare your answer: Your answer may vary, but here is a sample.</para>
    
    <para id="para-00010">Multiply the second equation by -5</para>
    
    <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>55</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<!--Question 2 -->
<exercise id="exer-00002">
  <problem id="prob-00002">
    <para id="para-00012">How do you know the system of equations in step 1 is equivalent to the original system?</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="sol-00002">
  <para id="para-00013">Compare your answer:</para>
    
    <para id="para-00014">Multiplying each side of an equation by the same number gives an equivalent equation with the same solution.</para>  
  </solution>
</exercise>
<!--Question 3 -->
<exercise id="exer-00003">
  <problem id="prob-00003">
    <para id="para-00015">Describe the move that Diego made between step 1 and step 2.</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="sol-00003">
  <para id="para-00016">Compare your answer:</para>
    
    <para id="para-00017">Add the resulting equation to the first equation to eliminate the variable <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
    
    <!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
    <para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" rowlines="none solid" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>55</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>70</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" rowlines="none solid" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>55</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>70</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->  
  </solution>
</exercise>
<!--Question 4 -->
<exercise id="exer-00004">
  <problem id="prob-00004">
    <para id="para-00019">How do you know the system of equations in step 2 is equivalent to the ones in step 1 (and to the original system)</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="sol-00004">
  <para id="para-00020">Compare your answer:</para>
    
    <para id="para-00021">Adding an equal amount to each side of an equation keeps the two sides equal, so the solution for the first equation is also a solution for the sum.</para>
  
  </solution>
</exercise>
<!--Question 5 -->
<exercise id="exer-00005">
  <problem id="prob-00005">
    <para id="para-00022">Write another set of equivalent systems (different from Diego's first two steps) that will allow one variable to be eliminated and enable you to solve the original system. Be prepared to describe the moves you make to create each new system and to explain why each one has the same solution as the original system.</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="sol-00005">
    <para id="para-00023">Compare your answer: Your answer may vary, but here is a sample.</para>
    
    <para id="para-00024">Original System of Equations</para>
    
    <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00026"><emphasis>Step 1 -</emphasis> Multiply the second equation by <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
    
    <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>33</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00028"><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Subtract the resulting equation from the first equation to eliminate the variable <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
    
    <!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
    <para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" rowlines="none solid" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>33</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>63</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" rowlines="none solid" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>33</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>63</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
    
    <para id="para-00030"><emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> Multiply the second equation by 2 to find the variable <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
    
    <!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
    <para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>63</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>63</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>63</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>63</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
  
  </solution>
</exercise>
<!--Question 6 -->
<exercise id="exer-00006">
  <problem id="prob-00006">
    <para id="para-00032">Use your equivalent systems to solve the original system. Then, check your solution by substituting the pair of values into the original system.</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="sol-00006">
    <para id="para-00033">Compare your answer:</para>
    
    <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00035">Original System of Equations</para>
    
    <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00037">Substitute the values into <emphasis>both</emphasis> original systems to check the solution.</para>
    
    <!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
  <para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mover><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mover><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>45</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mover><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mover><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>✓</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="3pt" columnspacing="0em 2em"><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mover><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mover><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>45</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mover><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mover><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>✓</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
    
    
    
    <!--BEGIN ALIGN TO EQUALS WITH LINE-->
